agent_clan_generation":"20260924150453","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-185.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-185[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Release the prompt bar at submit via detached pending launches[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Submitting from the ACE prompt input bar removes the bar on the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]very next paint in every launch flow. Kill/dismiss cleanup waits, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]provider/hold/dispatch preflights, and launch bookkeeping continue [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]as a visible, cancellable pending launch that hands off to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]durable `sase run` proc, and every abort path gives the prompt [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]back.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]detached_prompt_submit.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/detached_prompt_submit.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-185[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-185/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pending launch lifecycle and detached relaunch waits[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pending-launch[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending-launch: add the PendingLaunch record, restore helper, pending [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proc row, `,X` cancel of not-yet-submitted launches, and quit-time [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stash; unmount the bar ahead of the relaunch-cleanup/pending-kill holds;[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]move the synchronous post-unmount tail (MRU write, bulk Patch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution) off the UI thread.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hold and provider guards run after the bar unmounts[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detached-guards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pending-launch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detached-guards: move the acceptance point ahead of the `%hold` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hard-disabled-provider preflights, re-key both guards per pending launch[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with non-exclusive workers, and surface their decisions without stealing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus, restoring or stashing the prompt on abort.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Dispatch source preflight becomes a pending-launch stage[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]detached-dispatch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detached-guards[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detached-dispatch: post the submit immediately for `%dispatch` prompts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](syntax errors still keep the bar) and run the source preview as the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first pending-launch stage, restoring the prompt with the blocked-source[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line on failure.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt keystroke paths stop loading the project-tag catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keystroke-tag-catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keystroke-tag-catalog: add snapshot-only effective-tag helpers and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]convert keystroke, render, and submit-handler callers so typing and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Enter never revalidate or rebuild the project-tag catalog on the UI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]thread.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-185","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-185.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-75bc9976367e886584fe6447a72ae13f","started_at":"2026-09-24T19:15:19.869989+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"697ba9b17ac8e647b2fd337c6c38d72f706d5402ed411b0824c0b40878c9070d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"3c7e9dd7e2d09b783acd4b86056d667f1e5e237001b943527025ae04768a128c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/meta.json","size_bytes":676},"prompt":{"digest":"ad576d36e01aa170a03c6ee4eac1c7a67692381b84e1d325bc2f72315b82a694","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":145},"state":{"digest":"4171e48bea9f55412362e7492a91de91dbc5893a931d45b36d8f49bdcb352544","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3","local_name":"sase-185.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-185","agent_clan_generation":"20260924150453","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-185.3","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-185","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-185.3","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["sase-185.2"]},"source_run_id":"run-a232fb90752e3dae44d3f94682d3c0dd","started_at":"20260924150456","state":"waiting"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-185","bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.land"]}
